docs/adapter-setup.md:115:`--adapter` and `--type` are optional on `dap-cli launch` and `dap-cli attach`. When omitted, dap-cli infers the missing pieces from `--program` (extension) and from each other (`--type` → adapter via `launchConfigTypeMap`; `--adapter` → default DAP type). Explicit flags always win — passing `--adapter` AND/OR `--type` skips inference for that field, with no validation that the two agree.
